The agreement must identify the parties, covered material and versions,
permitted uses and deployments, term, fees and any agreed exceptions.
An enquiry, quote, download, fork or payment without an accepted agreement does
not by itself create a commercial licence. The rights holder may grant separate
written permissions on different terms.

